  "summary_en": "Peru's implementing regulation of Law 31814 on AI promotion. It sets guiding principles, designates the PCM's Digital Government Secretariat as national authority, establishes four risk tiers with prohibited and high-risk uses, high-risk obligations, AI-content labelling, security measures, a sandbox, and mandatory ISO/IEC 27002 for public entities. No robot-specific provisions.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Designates PCM's Secretariat of Government and Digital Transformation as national AI authority",
   "Four risk tiers: unacceptable (banned), high, medium, low",
   "High-risk uses listed (biometrics, education, employment, credit, health, justice, law enforcement) with obligations like logging, validation, data quality",
   "Mandatory visible labelling of AI-generated public content",
   "Regulatory sandbox and mandatory NTP-ISO/IEC 27002 for public entities; National AI Strategy due within one year"
